{"id":"vod_bf_20321","vodId":"20321","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"理科生坠入情网故尝试证明第一季","name_cn":"理科生坠入情网故尝试证明第一季","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-21/ba94a8b3250dc9f4cf8dc98d56800580.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在彩玉大学的理科研究室内，冰室菖蒲（雨宫天 配音）和雪村心夜（内田雄马 配音）是在这里工作的两名研究生。某日，让心夜没有想到的是，自己竟然收到了菖蒲的告白。所为万事以科学为上的理科研究生，对于爱情自然也要用符合逻辑的证据去证伪，为了证明菖蒲对自己的爱确有其事有迹可循，心夜带领着整个实验室开始了对爱的实验。　　每天都像佣人一样被使唤来使唤去的解说员奏言叶（原奈津子 配音）、性格反复无常，过于以自我为中心的棘田惠那（大森日雅 配音）、表面看来是个不良少年，实际上却是个死宅的犬饲虎辅（福岛润 配音），陪着菖蒲和心夜进行爱情实验的是这些可爱的研究员们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 06:57:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/likeshengzhuiruqingwangguchangshizhengmingdiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/likeshengzhuiruqingwangguchangshizhengmingdiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/likeshengzhuiruqingwangguchangshizhengmingdiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/likeshengzhuiruqingwangguchangshizhengmingdiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/likeshengzhuiruqingwangguchangshizhengmingdiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/likeshengzhuiruqingwangguchangshizhengmingdiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/likeshengzhuiruqingwangguchangshizhengmingdiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/likeshengzhuiruqingwangguchangshizhengmingdiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/likeshengzhuiruqingwangguchangshizhengmingdiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/likeshengzhuiruqingwangguchangshizhengmingdiyiji/第1